ttention to detail prevent me from committing to him at this stage. I propose we further evaluate Candidate\u202fC\u2019s leadership and situational awareness against B\u2019s reliability, and seek any additional observations from the panel that could clarify these trade\u2011offs before finalizing our recommendation."}
